  m_Name: Carta_MercadoDeCreditosDeCarbonoIndustrial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Mercado de Cr\xE9ditos de Carbono Industrial"
  _titleEn: Industrial Carbon Credit Market
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Num mercado de carbono, o governo limita as emiss\xF5es totais e as
    empresas compram e vendem permiss\xF5es para emitir."
  _summaryEn: In a carbon market, the government caps total emissions and companies
    buy and sell permits to emit.
  _realWorld: "O mercado europeu de emiss\xF5es funciona desde 2005; o Brasil criou
    o seu, o Sistema Brasileiro de Com\xE9rcio de Emiss\xF5es, pela Lei 15.042 de
    2024."
  _realWorldEn: The EU emissions market has run since 2005; Brazil created its own
    Emissions Trading System through Law 15,042 of 2024.
  _tradeOffs: "Com pre\xE7o baixo ou cr\xE9ditos de compensa\xE7\xE3o duvidosos,
    as emiss\xF5es n\xE3o caem de verdade."
  _tradeOffsEn: With low prices or dubious offset credits, emissions do not actually
    fall.
  _sources:
  - Label: EU Emissions Trading System (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/European_Union_Emissions_Trading_System
  - Label: Lei 15.042/2024 (Planalto)
    Url: https://www.planalto.gov.br/ccivil_03/_ato2023-2026/2024/lei/l15042.htm
